Template: serval/admin-group
Type: string
Default: sudo
Description: Host administration group for Serval:
 Members of this existing local group can administer Serval grants and, on
 non-protected services, view and reveal service environment values. Choose a
 group that already represents your host administrators.
 .
 The group must exist and must not be root's group. You can change it later
 with "dpkg-reconfigure serval" or "serval-setup admin-group".
